[Gm]Thou, [Cm]the [Dm]Fa[Bb]ther's [Adim]on[D]ly [Gm]Son, Hast o'er [Cm]sin the [F]vic[Bb]t'ry won.
Bound[F]less [Bb]shall [Eb]Thy [Cm]king[Gm]dom be; [Eb]When [Cm]shall [Dm]we [Gm]its [D]glories [Gm]see?
